text = "
[font_size=32][ul] Each combatant has 2 types, [i]Primary[/i] and [i]Secondary[/i].[/ul]

[ul] Your [i]Primary[/i] type is very inert, it won't change during battle.[/ul]

[ul] Your [i]Secondary[/i] type will change 0-2 times per attack.[ol] First, your [i]Secondary[/i] type will react with the attack's type.
 Second, your [i]Secondary[/i] type will react with your [i]Primary[/i] type.[/ol][/ul]

[ul] Your type is affected by your own melee attacks."
fit_content = true
